        <mxCell id="c49" value="&lt;i&gt;Both entries debit the loss account and the accumulated depreciation of the asset and credit its cost. Only the entry of 2025 also debits cash: the proceeds, 28,000.00, bring the loss down from 70,000.00, the cost less the accumulated depreciation, to 42,000.00. The entry of 2026 has no cash line, so its loss is the whole 92,500.00.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="310" width="860" height="53" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
